add_label_with_icon|big|`wThe Growtopia Gazette``|left|5016|
add_spacer|small|
add_image_button|banner|interface/large/news_banner.rttex|bannerlayout||
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|`wNovember 20th: `5Thanksgiving Week``|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_image_button|iotm_layout|interface/large/gazette/gazette_3columns_feature_btn06.rttex|3imageslayout|OPENSTORE|main/thanksgiving_bell_pack|
add_image_button|iotm_layout|interface/large/gazette/gazette_3columns_feature_btn08.rttex|3imageslayout|OPENSTORE|main/thanksgiving_weather|
add_image_button|iotm_layout|interface/large/gazette/gazette_3columns_feature_btn09.rttex|3imageslayout|OPENSTORE|main/gems_bundle06|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|The feast is on, and the flock is running wild as `2Thanksgiving Week`` has returned to Growtopia!|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|These turkeys aren't going down without a flap! Chase down those runaway birds and summon the legendary `6Sgt. Stuffins`` for a showdown that's sure to leave you stuffed with excitement! Join your fellow Growtopians to inflict damage, pile up rewards, and peck your way up the leaderboard for a chance to claim the coveted `9Thanksgiving Title``! Think you've got what it takes to rule the roost?|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|Keep the feast going with `4Stuffins' Support Package``! Packed with turkey-tastic goodies, each purchase also restores some of `6Sgt. Stuffins'`` health, giving the whole community more time to battle and scoop up some extra rewards!|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|To keep the festivities rolling, starting today until the end of `2Thanksgiving Week``, we're adding a flock of `8Organic Turkeys`` with every purchase of select Gem Packs!|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|We are also back with 2 new Sponsored Items `8Auino's Puppy`` and `8ashuex's Cool Caren``! Congrats Auino and ashuex on completing all the Epic Quests!|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|Roar into action and unleash your wild side with the November Grow Pass items!|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_label_with_icon|small|Item of the Season: `2Mighty Beast``|left|24|
add_label_with_icon|small|Royal Item of the Season: `2Royal Mighty Beast``|left|24|
add_label_with_icon|small|Subscriber Item: `8Monkey Plushie`` chosen by evauwU!|left|24|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|Freebie alert! Complete offers and earn for free!|left|
add_url_button|open_store|`wEarn Free Gems with Xsolla``|noflags|OPENSTORE|main/xsollawall|0|0|
add_url_button|open_store|`wEarn Free Gems with MyChips``|noflags|OPENSTORE|main/mafwall|0|0|
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|The Growtopia survey for the October Update is still open! By completing the survey, you will receive `22 Growtokens`` if you have Advanced Account Protection enabled. Complete the survey and claim your reward on your mobile device to let us know what you think!|left|
add_spacer|small|
add_url_button|survey|`wGive us your opinion!``|noflags|OPENSURVEY||
add_spacer|small|
add_textbox|Don't forget to join our `2Official Growtopia Discord Server`` on `2discord.gg/growtopia`` or click the link below!|left|
